{"rowNumber":297,"id":"stage_r07.mes#75148","kind":"text","speaker":"永遠","english":"","japanese":"永遠「……橋詰さんは……本当に、夫を裏切るおつもりなんですか？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":298,"id":"stage_r07.mes#75294","kind":"text","speaker":"大樹","english":"","japanese":"大樹「永遠さんの立場が悪くなるので正直な所、裏切りたくないんですが……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"음성 302","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":299,"id":"stage_r07.mes#75448","kind":"text","speaker":"大樹","english":"","japanese":"大樹「永遠さんが、彩子奥様にどうしても会わせようとしないのであれば……裏切らざるをえません」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"음성 303","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":300,"id":"stage_r07.mes#75622","kind":"text","speaker":"大樹","english":"","japanese":"大樹「なので俺を裏切らせるかどうかは、永遠さんが決めてください……俺は、貴方の決定に従う事にしますよ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"음성 304","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":301,"id":"stage_r07.mes#75924","kind":"text","speaker":"永遠","english":"","japanese":"永遠「そんなの……ただの脅しじゃないですか……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":302,"id":"stage_r07.mes#76054","kind":"text","speaker":"大樹","english":"","japanese":"大樹「そうですね、でも決めるのは永遠さんです……さぁ、どうしますか？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"음성 306","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":303,"id":"stage_r07.mes#76206","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"永遠はしばらく無言のまま、様々な葛藤を表すように表情を変えながら考えを巡らせていく……","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"음성 307","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":304,"id":"stage_r07.mes#76374","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そして彼女は諦めとも決意とも取れる追い詰められた者の目で、俺をジッと見据えてきた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"음성 308","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":305,"id":"stage_r07.mes#76771","kind":"text","speaker":"永遠","english":"","japanese":"永遠「……わ、わかりました……今から、お母様の所へ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"},
{"rowNumber":306,"id":"stage_r07.mes#76909","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ポツポツと降り出した雨に背中を押されるような形で……俺は永遠と共に屋敷の中へと足を運んだ。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"음성 310","voice":"","phaseId":"stage_r07-P1"}
